more than 60 years--

00:34:15.040 --> 00:34:17.530
no military takeover was there.

00:34:17.530 --> 00:34:20.050
And because India is so
huge, military takeover

00:34:20.050 --> 00:34:21.969
is actually not
very much feasible.

00:34:21.969 --> 00:34:25.659
But in Bangladesh, it's a
